recipe creamSoup
  milk : Milk 200 ml
  onion : Onion 1 pcs
  %1 = peel(onion) : Onion<shape: peeled> 1 pcs
  %2 = combine([%1, milk]) : Mixture 355.4..457 g with Allergen(milk)
  %3 = simmer(%2, 600 s) : Mixture<doneness: done> 355.4..457 g with Allergen(milk)
menu lunch
  %1 = make creamSoup() : CreamSoup<doneness: done> 355.4..457 g with Allergen(milk)
result ok errors=0 warnings=0 infos=0
exit 0
